Hi,

Our security scan tools have detected following neo4j related vulnerabiliti=
es for below library present in kafka 4.3.0 /libs/activation-1.1.1.jar

CVEs are -

CVE-2021-34371
CVE-2026-1524
CVE-2026-1497
CVE-2026-1337
CVE-2026-1471

Please confirm if kafka is impacted due to this vulnerabilities. If yes, wh=
at is mitigation plan.

Regards
Vivek

