nk.m.maheshwari@ericsson.com>
Subject: Kafka 4.4.0 formal release date

Hi,

As per Release Plan 4.4.0 - Apache Kafka - Apache Software Foundation<https=
://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/spaces/KAFKA/pages/429064575/Release+Plan+4.=
4.0>, the formal release for Kafka 4.4.0 is planned for 9th Sep.
Could you please confirm that the release date remains unchanged and that t=
here are no updates to the current schedule?

Regards
Vivek

