Hello Apache Kafka Team,



In our product, kafka v4.3.0 is used. Below 3 Jli zstd-jni related vulnerab=
ilities are reported on this kafka version -



CVE-2026-87795

CVE-2026-87823

CVE-2026-87825


I see in Kafka 4.4.0 rc, zstd: "1.5.6-10" is included. However the fix for =
these 3 vulnerabilities is in Fixed version: 1.5.7-14 and later.

Please confirm whether kafka 4.4.0 formal release will have fix for these v=
ulnerabilities?

Regards
Vivek

