Hello Kafka users, developers and client-developers,

This is the second (RC1) candidate for release of Apache Kafka 4.2.2.

This is a bug fix release in the 4.2 line.

Release notes for the 4.2.2 release:
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.2.2-rc1/RELEASE_NOTES.html

Please download, test and vote by *24 September, Monday 5PM PST*

Kafka's KEYS file containing PGP keys we use to sign the release:
https://downloads.apache.org/kafka/KEYS <https://kafka.apache.org/KEYS>

* Release artifacts to be voted upon (source and binary):
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.2.2-rc1/

* Docker release artifacts to be voted upon:
apache/kafka:4.2.2-rc1
<https://hub.docker.com/layers/apache/kafka/4.2.2-rc1/images/sha256-daa39dc85acd37b148fad74d6b22b60fa5f7fa05048a5c8aa3b654140c63dd58>
apache/kafka-native:4.2.2-rc1
<https://hub.docker.com/layers/apache/kafka-native/4.2.2-rc1/images/sha256-eae4a5c3675030bb3c854eb89fab50bbb75fd2f7800d4385b0b3fda642852d2b>

* Maven artifacts to be voted upon:
https://repository.apache.org/content/groups/staging/org/apache/kafka/

* Javadoc:
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.2.2-rc1/javadoc/index.html

* Tag to be voted upon (off 4.2 branch) is the 4.2.2 tag:
https://github.com/apache/kafka/releases/tag/4.2.2-rc1

* Documentation:
https://kafka.apache.org/42/documentation.html

* Protocol:
https://kafka.apache.org/42/design/protocol

* Successful CI builds for the 4.2 branch:
Unit/integration tests:
https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/35636810731
System tests: Before Test Only fix -
https://confluent-open-source-kafka-system-test-results.s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/4.2/2026-09-20--002.7c3ba21d-079a-4799-8f1e-1f798f499541--1789972353--confluentinc--4.2--0fbf14c557/report.html
I have retriggered system tests though; will update the thread.

* Successful Docker Image Github Actions Pipeline for 4.2 branch:
Docker Build Test Pipeline (JVM):
https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/35637052515
Docker Build Test Pipeline (Native):
https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/35637084838

Regards,
Apoorv Mittal

