Hi Vivek,
Because of the process for releasing versions in the ASF, we can't really
give you an exact date until the very same day the release happens (or in
some cases a couple of days before). Each Release Candidate is proposed and
must be validated by the community and maintainers. Currently, we are
testing RC1 and it seems there are some problems. So probably another
release candidate needs to be created.

Best,

